      "extract": "We study the question of whether submodular functions of random variables satisfying various notions of negative dependence satisfy Chernoff-like concentration inequal- ities. We prove such a concentration inequality for the lower tail when the random variables satisfy negative association or negative regression, partially resolving an open problem raised in ([1]). Previous work showed such concentration results for",
      "extractCut": true
    },
