      "extract": "We ﬁrst deﬁne the weaker notion of negative dependence which we work with, called 1-negative association, and prove some simple properties about it. We also deﬁne a related notion of weak negative regression, which is the analogue of 1-negative asso- ciation for the notion of negative regression, and we show the equivalence between the two for binary random variables and show that weak negative regression is",
